Z||000043||Nashco||12-09-2001||03:19 AM||||1s - 3<BR>2s - 2<BR>3s - 7<BR>4s - 2<P>That's one more 1 to the list.<P>David:  The next step is just to order them from Held Motorsports.  The group buy does not need to be made all at once; at the end of the month Dave will let us know where the price discount stands and process all the orders accordingly.  This list is simply to keep track of how many people are ordering so that we can show people how many are buying and that their WILL be more discount if more people get in on it.<P>The discount right now isn't too impressive, not much to have a party for, but a discount nonetheless; BUT, if we get more people to commit, prices could drop drastically.<P>Funny how things work; if there was a $100 dollar off discount, lots of people would be ordering...but since many people don't want to purchase until the price actually gets low, there isn't much response.  Silly people <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Like I said, I'll be ordering mine soon.  When I do, I'll ask Dave for an update on the discount so far, and let you guys know.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
