Z||000050||Nashco||12-10-2001||12:23 AM||||Good point Daleford.<P>I asked Dave, and there is a starting discount of 20 dollars, so there is a guaranteed discount comparable to at least 20 people.<P>This should get a few more people interested.  20 bucks is a fair discount, even if we don't get more than that.  I'm hoping there will be at least 30 or so, but perhaps I'm dreaming <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>So, those of you riding the fence, this makes it so the price now is cheaper than normal.  If you're going to buy them eventually, why wait?<P>Ha...I'm starting to sound WAY too much like a salesman for Held Motorsports!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
